# Step 5 - Model Input Artifacts

This directory is used to store the processed datasets prepared as inputs for the machine learning models.

The generated model input files, including the feature matrices (`X_*.npy`) and target arrays (`y_train.npy` and `y_val.npy`), are stored separately on Google Drive due to their large file sizes.

The files can be accessed through the project's Google Drive directory:

`IEEE_CIS_Project/artifacts/artifacts_step5_model_inputs/`

These artifacts are generated during the model input preparation stage of the main notebook.
